Room: the video picture-in-picture window's controls restyled by //room.

The user asked for Dia's look on the floating video (5.12): Back to Tab and
Close as labelled pills, the origin centred, the playback buttons growing a
little under the pointer. VideoOverlayWindowViews builds and lays out its
views itself with no seam for an embedder, so two calls hand them to //room:
once the views exist and after each layout. //room keeps Chrome's buttons as
the click targets (transparent, stretched over Room's pills) so the window's
hit test and accessibility stay Chrome's.

Phase 5.12, 2026-11-01. //room: room/browser/room_video_overlay.mm.
diff --git a/chrome/browser/ui/views/overlay/video_overlay_window_views.cc b/chrome/browser/ui/views/overlay/video_overlay_window_views.cc
